		(property "Description" "Standard Voltage: VDD and VDDQ = 1.5V +/- 0.075V  Low Voltage (L): VDD and VDDQ = 1.35V + 0.1V, -0.067V  - Backward compatible to 1.5V  High speed data transfer rates with system frequency up to 1066 MHz  8 internal banks for concurrent operation  8n-bit pre-fetch architecture  Programmable CAS Latency  Programmable Additive Latency: 0, CL-1,CL-2  Programmable CAS WRITE latency (CWL) based on tCK  Programmable Burst Length: 4 and 8  Programmable Burst Sequence: Sequential or Interleave"
